assist Eric Lemons hosting you as you uncover this old school jazz venue to
 
 enjoy a different jazz experience. Get your ticket for our private event. 
 
Both Eric and Debbie have been involved in the world of music entertainment
 
 for years presenting major artist. The list is long. They really know thei
 
r way around the business. Tables and seats are still limited. Make early p
 
urchases. NOTES DRESS TO IMPRESS --- It's the Jazz Age! Cocktail and Jazz p
 
